s\n\nWill be added in the future:\n- 3D Doors\n- 3D variated shelves\n- 3D Command block(s)\n- Variated obsidian\n- 3D Ladders\n- Corals\n- Translucent cobwebs\n- 3D Fireworks\n- 3D Bow\n- Item sprite 3D arrows\n\n</details>\n\nHow to load with programmer art: \n\nMake sure you load Story Mode Blocks above Programmer Art and your Programmer Art continuation pack of choice!\n\n</details>",
